[5.023077, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;240m\u001b[1;3H the run: kill the coordinator, restart it ───────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m\u001b[5C processes ──────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;240m\u001b[20;82H the store ──────────────────────────\u001b[H──\u001b[74C──┬──\u001b[37C──\u001b[2;79H│\u001b[3;79H│\u001b[4;79H│\u001b[5;79H│\u001b[6;79H│\u001b[7;79H│\u001b[8;79H│\u001b[9;79H│\u001b[10;79H│\u001b[11;79H│\u001b[12;79H│\u001b[13;79H│\u001b[14;79H│\u001b[15;79H│\u001b[16;79H│\u001b[17;79H│\u001b[18;79H│\u001b[19;79H│\u001b[20;79H├──\u001b[37C──\u001b[21;79H│\u001b[22;79H│\u001b[23;79H│\u001b[24;79H│\u001b[25;79H│\u001b[26;79H│\u001b[27;79H│\u001b[28;79H│\u001b[29;79H│\u001b[30;79H│\u001b[31;79H│\u001b[32;79H│\u001b[33;79H│\u001b[34;79H│\u001b[35;79H│\u001b[36;79H│\u001b[37;79H│\u001b[38;79H│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2;1H[demo] built fakeagent and the before-world coordinator into out/bin\u001b[10X\u001b[3;78H\u001b[1K\r\n=========================================================================\u001b[5X\r\n[demo] BEFORE TEMPORAL -- the coordinator holds the procedure in process memor\u001b[6;78H\u001b[1K\ry\r\n[demo] coordinator loop up; it claims the work and waits for the agent inline\u001b[1X\n\u001b[1K\r[demo] generation 1 agent is mid-work\r\n[demo] coordinator killed (kill -9). Agent processes still alive: 1\u001b[11X\r\n[demo] the claim survived in the store; everything around it just vanished\u001b[4X\u001b[11;78H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[2;80Hmeasured with pgrep, twice a second\u001b[K\u001b[3;80H\u001b[K\n  coordinator  0\u001b[K\u001b[5;80H  agent        1\u001b[K\u001b[6;80H\u001b[K\n  >> agent outlived its launcher\u001b[K\u001b